VIEWMODEL.md §4.5: a slider on a number type with a lower bound and no upper one is E1619 (upper), UInt64 included.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local record Item {
  count: Int(0..)
  big: UInt64
  delay: Duration(1s..)
}

view Item {
  count { control: slider }
  big { control: slider }
  delay { control: slider }
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E1619]  a/a.canon:10:20
  slider needs both bounds, and Int(0..) has no upper bound

error[E1619]  a/a.canon:11:18
  slider needs both bounds, and UInt64 has no upper bound

error[E1619]  a/a.canon:12:20
  slider needs both bounds, and Duration(1s..) has no upper bound

3 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
